    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the chaotic world of Mad Way !  </h2><br>In Mad Way, players find themselves in a world devoid of meaning, where the laws of physics seem to have disappeared. Their main objective is to climb over a distance of several kilometers, using various game mechanics to reach new heights.<br><br>The game presents a multitude of exciting challenges for players. Moving platforms are one of these challenges, requiring precise coordination and mastery of jumps to avoid falling. Players must remain vigilant and quickly adapt to the erratic movements of these platforms, as a fall can send them back a long way. You can also use bouncy platforms provide an extra boost, allowing you to reach higher areas or traverse larger gaps. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289400/extras/d76be373742044d4e0fd2458f90942e3.poster.avif?t=1694021344\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289400/extras/d76be373742044d4e0fd2458f90942e3.webm?t=1694021344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2289400/extras/d76be373742044d4e0fd2458f90942e3.mp4?t=1694021344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>To add an extra dose of adrenaline, &quot;Mad Way&quot; also features vehicles that can be used to climb faster. Players can jump aboard these wild contraptions and navigate through the chaotic environment. However, they must exercise caution, as the slightest mistake can result in a fall and the loss alot of your progress.<br><br>One of the most competitive aspects of &quot;Mad Way&quot; is the presence of a global leaderboard. Players have the opportunity to compete against the best climbers worldwide by attempting to beat record times. This adds a competitive dimension and encourages players to constantly improve their skills and climbing speed. <br>In summary, &quot;Mad Way&quot; is an exhilarating climbing game that transports players to a nonsensical world where gravity has lost its hold. With stimulating gameplay mechanics such as trampolines, moving platforms, wild vehicles, and a global leaderboard, players are immersed in an addictive experience where a fall can send them back a long way. Get ready to defy the laws of physics, utilize trampolines to your advantage, and conquer the heights",
